Package: synveil
Version: @SYNVEIL_VERSION@
Architecture: @SYNVEIL_ARCH@
Maintainer: Synveil Project <synveil-dev@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SYNVEIL_INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SYNVEIL_DEPENDS@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Synveil desktop and background synchronization runtime (Linux)
 Synveil desktop shell and separately supervised background synchronization
 client, plus the existing one-shot scheduled-maintenance runtime.
 .
 The desktop and client executables remain separate. The client user service
 is installed below /usr/lib/systemd/user and is never silently enabled by
 package installation. Enable it explicitly with systemctl --user after
 reviewing the local profile configuration.
 .
 The package does NOT contain database credentials; the administrator
 provisions /etc/synveil/credentials/database-url (root:root 0600) separately.
 The scheduled-maintenance timer is also NOT auto-enabled and its service is
 NOT auto-started on install.
 .
 Package signing and APT repository publishing are deferred to release
 engineering (unsigned CI artifact at this stage).
